    discard();
    // CLEARED, never rewound: a fresh run inherits no undo log, and the
    // previous run's directories — if it committed — are the host's now.
    MADE.with(|m| m.borrow_mut().clear());
    COMMITTED.with(|c| *c.borrow_mut() = false);""")

